TALLY: 3 new cases red (`run#aDelayedTickSelectsTheRowsItWasScheduledFor`,
`run#theWindowDoesNotSelectThePreviousTicksRow`, `workflow#theTickDeclaresItsWindow`), 0 of the 40
pre-existing cases red. Each of the three debug lines is the case's own reason, in the same run.
